    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33452" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλάττ-ωμα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>,
			τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>inferiority, disadvantage</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				18.237
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				2.29S.
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. ποιεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					6.16.3
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>loss, defeat</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IPE</u>
				12.32<i>B</i>15
			</span></i> (pl., Olbia, <span class="entity">iii B.C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				1.32.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Onos.
				32.8
			</span></i> (pl.), etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>defect</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατὰ τὴν ὄψιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					5.23
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περὶ τὴν λέξιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Th.</u>
					35
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ τῶν παιδικῶν ἐ</span>. Chor.in<i><span class="en">
				<u>Rh.Mus.</u>
				49.510
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δωματικὰ ἐ</span>. Hierocl.<i><span class="en">
				p.49A.
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Ir.</u>
				p.52
			</span></i> W., al., <i><span class="en">
				Iamb.
				<u>Protr.</u>
				20
			</span></i> (v. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλάσσωμα</span>).</div>
